            "review_title": "Review at Hoang Tam",
            "review_text": "Lana I\n10 contributions\n0\nAuthentic food experience\nMar 2026 • Family\nWe were introduced to this restaurant from our tour guide and were so happy he did. The first indication that it was good was how busy it was, next was the food…absolutely fantastic, fresh and delicious. They’re known for their pancakes and it certainly didn’t disappoint, we ended our meal with a coconut ice cream that had a frozen banana centre…awesome!\nWould recommend for sure and would be on our radar the next time we visit HCM.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBest to reserve around the dinner hour as it does get busy with its popularity.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 9, 2026",
