            "review_title": "Review at Hoang Tam",
            "review_text": "Peter K\nRyde, Australia571 contributions\n0\nThe best Bahn Xeo restaurant(s) in HCM\nNov 2023 • Family\nAmazing restaurant, ate here especially for the Bahn Xeo and we weren't disappointed. The staff are excellent and helpful, English is spoken by many of the staff. There are several 'branches' throughout HCM and all are of the same quality and I recommend this restaurant for the best 'pancakes' in HCM for freshness, quality and take your appetite as they are huge.\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2023",
